{"id":"640005","name":"蒜苗鹅肉肠焖饭","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/640005/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"蒜苗","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鹅肉肠","amount":"1根"},{"name":"大米","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酱油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"蒜苗清洗干净后切成长段。","img":"images/640005/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鹅肉肠切片。","img":"images/640005/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"起锅热油，把鹅肉肠炒一炒。","img":"images/640005/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入蒜苗翻炒。","img":"images/640005/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再加入盐、酱油、胡椒粉调味。","img":"images/640005/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"米饭距时间结束还差十分钟。","img":"images/640005/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"赶紧炒好蒜苗，铲入煲好的米饭中，焖至米饭熟透。","img":"images/640005/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"米饭焖好后，用勺子拌匀入味即可。","img":"images/640005/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品。简单又好吃。","img":"images/640005/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}